   "message": "The tests cover only the pure `gateMode()` function. Nothing checks that `register` shows the 'unknown gate mode' toast at session.start, nor that the mode it computes reaches the gate decision. If the `notify` line or the `mode` wiring were dropped, every test would still pass. The MOD.md claim that a toast at session start names the value is therefore unproven. Add a test that drives `register` with `{gate: 'deny'}` and asserts the toast text and the effective mode. Also add `null` and numeric rows to MODE_ROWS.",
